+          // DELIBRA-PATCH: race the sessionParticipant await against a
+          // 10-second timeout. With the patched @empirica/tajriba (see
+          // DELIBRA_RECONNECT_PATCHES.md), connectionStatus() still
+          // resolves on raw WS opened, but if auth drops mid-handshake the
